+# Owner decision memo — action transfer to Record formation
+
+## Decision exposed
+
+The current axioms determine a normalized local possibility distribution
+conditional on formation, but explicitly do not determine formation site or
+rate. Block 50 proves that a positive constant-determinant transfer can control
+both content and relative formation activity through one falsifiable law, and
+that two microscopic blank architectures give different Record-only race
+predictions.
+
+This is a downstream Record-formation law, not an interpretation note and not
+an automatic amendment to the four axioms.
+
+## Narrow candidate wording
+
+> For every registered exposure and eligible Record-free target `x` with
+> frozen neighboring condition `eta`, a supplied positive local transfer
+> `W_eta` defines the physical marked append intensity
+> `nu_eta(dn)=gamma_* Tr[W_eta P_n] mu(dn)`, where `mu` is one fixed normalized
+> registered mark measure and `gamma_*>0` is common across the comparison. The
+> branch appends the matching mark; an occupied target has zero append
+> intensity. Disjoint jointly exposed targets combine by the additive
+> pure-birth generator until the first append. Repeat trials use fresh targets
+> and never erase Records. Across the comparison family, `W_0` is isotropic
+> and `det W_eta=det W_0`.
+
+For an action presentation, the last sentence may instead require
+`W_eta=exp(-A_eta)` with dimensionless Hermitian `A_eta` and
+`Tr A_eta` independent of `eta`.
+
+## What this would supply
+
+- a single unnormalized marked measure whose normalization is the formation
+  hazard and whose conditional law is Admissibility content;
+- the constant-determinant rate/content relation;
+- clock-free relative races between Record-certified eligible sites; and
+- matching append output plus occupied-site absorption at the declared process
+  level.
+
+## What it would not supply
+
+- the physical action or transfer `W_eta` itself;
+- why a particular matter/gravity sector is that transfer;
+- the event codec/POVM or its microscopic writer;
+- the blank carrier, reset/fresh-target capacity, or composite Record typing;
+- the value of the absolute clock multiplier `gamma_*`;
+- empirical truth, typicality, or an observed Record corpus; or
+- a retained audit verdict or formal TOE obligation retirement.
+
+Setting `gamma_*=1` per physical tick is a separate absolute clock decision.
+The race theorem cancels this scale and cannot determine it.
+
+## Recommendation
+
+Do not modify `MINIMAL_AXIOMS_2026-06-29.md`. If the owner approves the
+physical idea after the architecture choice, register the exact sentence as a
+narrow approved downstream primitive or candidate law consumed only by Record
+formation claims. The approved text must choose one of:
+
+1. memoryless orthogonal/hybrid blank formation, predicting `4/9` in the exact
+   Block 50 race;
+2. same-qubit survival filtering, predicting `1/2`; or
+3. neither, leaving both as falsifiable candidate theories.
+
+No wording becomes authoritative without an owner-approved decision and the
+normal repository custody/audit path.
