+# Independent panel return
+
+The postexecution panel checked foundations, the two microscopic constructions,
+the grading escape, and hostile prior art. The primary runner closes at
+`PASS=12 FAIL=0`; the independent implementation closes at `PASS=7 FAIL=0`.
+Neither execution supplies observational evidence or an audit verdict.
+
+## Foundations / axiom reading
+
+The retained Minimal Axioms permit the displayed laws as downstream candidates
+but do not select an action-to-marked-intensity map. Admissibility supplies a
+normalized possibility distribution conditional on formation and explicitly
+withholds formation site and rate. It does not supply exponentiation, the
+linear trace/event-flux identification, an absolute multiplier, a quantum blank
+sector, reset, eligibility, additive races, or a cross-site grading.
+
+The exact freedom is `nu_eta -> g(eta) nu_eta` for any positive covariant
+`g`: conditional Record content is unchanged while races change. A common
+scalar action shift is degenerate with `gamma_*`; an `eta`-dependent scalar
+shift is observable. The current axioms recognize no-Record absence and require
+one permanent Record per occupied site, but they do not identify absence with a
+qubit state or construct absorbing dynamics. The narrow candidate belongs in a
+downstream formation-law decision, not as an unpacking of the four axioms.
+
+## Mathematical and microscopic result
+
+Under the supplied linear event-flux law,
+
+```text
+nu_eta(dn) = gamma_* Tr(W_eta P_n) mu(dn),
+W_eta = alpha_eta (I + r_eta.sigma),
+```
+
+the panel confirms the exact biconditional
+
+```text
+det W_eta = det W_0
+  iff Gamma_eta/Gamma_0 = 1/sqrt(1-|r_eta|^2)
+```
+
+for an isotropic baseline. This is a constant-determinant positive-transfer
+theorem, not an exponential-specific signature. `W=exp(-A)` with traceless
+`A` is sufficient; without an independently fixed action, `A=-log W` is only a
+reparameterization.
+
+Both stopped-process completions are exact but physically different. The
+same-qubit Kraus route is CP and normalized, while its no-jump branch filters
+the neutral blank, gives non-exponential survival, and yields the base mark law
+after integrating over all formation times. It also needs an external stop or
+occupancy flag to make the formed Record permanent. The orthogonal-blank route
+is memoryless and absorbing, but adds a status sector. Its `W^(1/2)` Kraus
+factorization is basis/Kraus gauge; after summation it implements the already
+supplied scalar intensity `q(n)` and does not derive that intensity from the
+axioms.
+
+At `W_1=I`, `W_2=diag(2,1/2)`, the memoryless race gives `4/9` and the
+survival-filter race gives `1/2`. That joined same-positive-transfer
+parametrization comparison is the packet's useful narrow increment.
+
+## Grading compatibility
+
+There is no retained grading contradiction: grading is an optional open
+hypothesis. Conditional on operational parity evenness, two modes carry an
+even logical qubit but no same-parity orthogonal blank. Three qubits provide a
+finite escape with `|B>=|000>`, `|0_L>=|011>`, and `|1_L>=|101>`; the logical
+projectors and blank-to-Record jumps are even. This does not yet define a
+literal lattice Record. Composite identity, decoder, joint writing, covariant
+block allocation, overlap arbitration, and the cross-site product remain
+supplied.
+
+## Hostile prior art and value
+
+The action-to-positive-marked-Poisson side is already substantially owned by
+open PR `#7326` (`5943991368`). Block 19 (`278abf6cd9`, packet head
+`ac643ece3f`) owns Kraus-complete writers, no-jump histories, and clock-free
+races. Block 49 (`af4a8a8241`) already states the `cosh =
+1/sqrt(1-|r|^2)` target and requests the joint content/race falsifier. Main
+already contains the relevant no-jump/backaction boundaries, and Block 43
+(`3c375f8cfa`) owns the two-mode even logical repair. The three-qubit lift is a
+short dimension-count extension.
+
+The exact Route-Q versus Route-B survival comparison and `4/9` versus `1/2`
+witness were not found verbatim and earn narrow V2/V5 credit. They do not turn
+the supplied event-flux sentence into an action-derived physical law.
+
+## Consensus
+
+```text
+shipping_decision: BACKLOG_NO_PR
+V1: FAIL
+V2: NARROW PASS
+V3: FAIL
+V4: FAIL
+V5: NARROW PASS
+obligation_retirement: 0
+toe_percentage_movement: 0
+```
+
+Preserve the same-qubit filter, orthogonal/hybrid blank, explicit stop/reset,
+fresh-target archive, restricted-menu, parity-safe block, environmental,
+non-Markov, and direct-positive-transfer routes. Promotion requires an
+independently retained physical action that derives the event flux, or an
+actual Record corpus that discriminates the candidate architectures.
