+# Postexecution no-go audit
+
+The N1--N8 discipline passes for two narrow boundaries only:
+
+1. the current retained axioms do not entail the supplied
+   action/transfer-to-marked-intensity law; and
+2. on one two-dimensional Kraus carrier, a designated nonzero append jump
+   cannot have zero post-formation intensity on every ray of the complete pure
+   Record orbit.
+
+No universal Record-formation, action, carrier, axiom-necessity, or TOE no-go
+is eligible.
+
+## N1 — materially distinct routes
+
+| Route | Postexecution result |
+|---|---|
+| same-qubit survival filter | exact CP law; keeps no-jump filtering and needs a stop/occupancy flag for permanence |
+| orthogonal blank/Record direct sum | exact memoryless absorbing law; adds one status level |
+| hybrid pure-birth Record state | live; uses ontic no-Record status without retyping a site as a qutrit |
+| explicit stop, reset, or fresh target | live; makes the history input visible rather than hiding it |
+| restricted nonspanning mark menu | live; avoids the full-orbit carrier boundary |
+| three-qubit fixed-parity block | exact finite even escape; composite Record placement remains open |
+| environment-carried flag or reversible dilation | live outside the narrow same-carrier theorem |
+| non-Markov or deterministic history | live; the hazard/race target is not universal over these laws |
+
+## N2 — collapsed-wall audit
+
+The genuine residuals are: `W1`, independent physical selection of `W` and its
+context-dependent scalar representative; `W2`, transfer-to-event-flux and
+matching-output identification; `W3`, blank/absorption/eligibility/race/reset
+history; `W4`, the common absolute rate unit; and optional `W5`, grading and
+composite-block placement. Closing any one does not close the others.
+
+Exponentiation is not an extra wall once a positive transfer is supplied.
+Likewise, a common scalar action shift and `gamma_*` are one rate convention,
+not two walls. Route B's `W^(1/2)` Kraus factorization is a realization of W2,
+not a derivation of W2.
+
+## N3 — hidden-condition scan
+
+The packet keeps visible the action source, scalar representative, event
+measure and trace pairing, matching codec, neutral blank preparation, no-jump
+backaction, post-jump stop, common rate, frozen simultaneous eligibility,
+collision freedom, fresh capacity, empirical typicality, and composite Record
+decoder. Absence at an unread target is never counted as an observed datum.
+
+## N4 — exact residual matching
+
+- Minimal Axioms lines 60--69 and 116--130 support only the conditional-content
+  and current-entailment boundary.
+- Open PR `#7326` (`5943991368`) already owns a selected
+  action-derived positive marked Poisson intensity; it does not make that map
+  current-axiom content.
+- Block 19's source (`278abf6cd9`; packet `ac643ece3f`) owns the supplied QND
+  writer, no-jump histories, and generic clock-free race machinery.
+- Block 49 (`af4a8a8241`) already records the target rate/content equation and
+  the requested joint falsifier.
+- `MINIMAL_RECORD_INSTRUMENT_DILATION_SCALAR_EXCHANGE_NONSELECTION...` and the
+  Cycle-26 fortress note own the closest main-branch no-jump/backaction
+  boundaries.
+- Block 43 (`3c375f8cfa`) owns the two-mode even repair; only the explicit
+  same-parity blank extension is added here.
+
+Each source is used at its exact residual. Open or unaudited work is prior art,
+not retained premise authority.
+
+## N5 — rhetoric and resolution
+
+```text
+N5_rhetoric: PASS for narrow same-carrier and current-entailment boundaries
+per_element: positive qubit transfer, determinant, effects, and Kraus weights
+per_site: one survival-filter writer and one orthogonal-blank writer
+per_mode: finite cubic marks and the fixed-parity dimension count
+per_block: two co-enabled sites and the 4/9 versus 1/2 race
+lattice_wide: not executed; allocation, collisions, recurrence, and infinite-volume existence remain open
+```
+
+## N6 — partial closures and primitives
+
+The scale primitive supplies units only, kinetic isotropy supplies only
+`c_t=c_s` in form, and the realized-state primitive supplies only pointwise
+evaluation. None supplies action identification, event flux, rate, reset, or
+grading. Hybrid status, explicit stop/reset, fresh archives, finite menus,
+parity-safe blocks, enlarged environments, and owner adoption of a downstream
+formation law remain live.
+
+## N7 — strongest steelman
+
+The Record ontology already distinguishes no Record from Record content, so a
+hybrid pure-birth law needs no qutrit site. The same-qubit filter is also a
+complete physical law if its time-dependent hazard is intended. Both points
+are correct and defeat any broader carrier no-go; they do not defeat the
+qualified linear-algebra statement about one designated append jump on one
+two-dimensional carrier.
+
+## N8 — cross-cycle echo
+
+Earlier work already separated content from rate, visible renewal from reset,
+action coefficients from append intensities, and one-site grading from
+multi-site encoding. Block 50 preserves those lessons. Its narrow new
+comparison does not erase the earlier live hybrid, distributed, reset,
+finite-menu, or history-dependent routes.
+
+**Disposition:** `PASS` for the two narrow boundaries above; `FAIL / DO NOT
+SHIP` for any global no-go. Overall packet disposition remains
+`BACKLOG_NO_PR`, with zero obligation retirement and zero TOE movement.
